`brief.md` requirements (BtoB SaaS 顧客管理 screen for sales/CS staff):
- List customers, add a customer, open a separate detail screen, edit the selected customer, delete a finished customer.
- List columns: 企業名、担当者、最終対応日、ステータス. Detail: 会社名、担当者名、メールアドレス、電話番号、ステータス、対応メモ. Use the 4 fixture companies in `src/fixtures.ts`.
